<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43082" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταιρ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταῖρος</span> or <i>comrade</i> to any
			one, c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρὶ ἑταιρίσσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.335
				</span></i>
			 ; of the Graces, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ven.</u>
				96
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> trans. in 
				Med.
			, <i>associate with oneself, choose for one's comrade,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤ τινά που Τρώων ἑταρίσσαιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.456
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				206
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Naumach.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.23.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>win over,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Hann.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BC</u>
				3.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταιρεύομαι</span>
			, <i>to be a courtesan,</i> in 
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				7.3
			</span></i> ; of a man, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				261
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.593b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(4).169
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>associate with</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταῖραι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				1012
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
